  abilityDesc: 22 combo Dark attack on all foes (damage relative to remaining HP),
    15% damage reduction from all element types for 2 turns, spark damage fills BB
    gauge for 3 turns, restores HP for 3 turns, probable evasion for 2 turns & probable
    KO resistance
